   1++6694              ; =========================================================================
   2++6694              ; PROJECT126 — ATM Turbo 2+ / NeoGS host-side IPC driver
   3++6694              ; Version: P126_ATM_IPC v0.1.0
   4++6694              ;
   5++6694              ; This is ATM Z80 code. It runs on the 7 MHz host CPU.
   6++6694              ; NeoGS is an independent Z80 and has its own private debug port #EF.
   7++6694              ;
   8++6694              ; The implementation follows the proven Project125 host transport v2
   9++6694              ; handshake semantics. It intentionally contains no NeoGS-local IN/OUT
  10++6694              ; and does not program DMA_MOD/HAD/MAD/LAD/CST from the ATM side.
