 111++6694              ; IMAGE service v1.1 image profiles.
 112++6694              ; IMAGE_BEGIN payload: message-id u16, image-kind u8, physical-page u8,
 113++6694              ; exact image-size u16. The receiver validates kind/page policy and derives
